      "side": 1,
      "message": "Gitiles serves the same host index view with or without a trailing slash on the URL path (for example, `/foo` and `/foo/`, or `/b` and `/b/` when mounted under a servlet context path), since `ViewFilter` and `GitilesView.setRepositoryPrefix` strip leading and trailing slashes without redirecting. Normalizing trailing slashes on `location.pathname` here (such as `location.pathname.replace(/\\/+$/, \u0027\u0027) || \u0027/\u0027`) would avoid splitting recent-repository history across two `localStorage` keys for the same index.\n\n_from potto_",
